"Setting Type to \"Pseudo-Transparent\" will make the window transparent but "
"the window will have a shadow. The shadow can be disabled by configuring "
"your window manager."
msgstr ""
"Configurar el Tipo como \"Pseudo-Transparente\" hará la ventana transparente "
"pero la ventana tendrá una sombra. La sombra se puede deshabilitar "
"configurando tu gestor de ventanas."

